abstract: |
  MIS v2.1 introduces revolutionary token-based security orchestration for autonomous 
  AI agents. Key innovations include: (1) cryptographic capability tokens validated 
  in eBPF with <50ns latency (200x faster than traditional LSMs); (2) intent-driven 
  execution contracts that map high-level goals to fine-grained permissions; 
  (3) distributed session orchestration with live migration support. Benchmarks 
  demonstrate 2000+ concurrent sessions per node with <0.5% CPU overhead. Released 
  under MIT license as a reference architecture for both academic research and 
  commercial production systems.

